    optimize: presize-indexmap-from-file-size [KEPT] -41.2% on reopen_10k
    
    Reserve IndexMap capacity from the on-disk file size (file_size / 24)
    before the replay loop in open_with, eliminating the geometric grow-
    rehash sequence as entries stream in. Across 3 independent runs against
    the fixed pre-change baseline: reopen_10k -41.20% / -41.28% / -41.18%
    (p50 ~358us -> ~210us); all other scenarios within +/-1% noise. No
    regressions. Verdict KEPT per /optimize gate.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/lib.rs b/src/lib.rs
